# WordPress marketing brand (source of truth)

**Traffic model:** Customers use **WordPress** (`aicoachingsolutions.net`) for marketing and click through to **Vercel** (`app.aicoachingsolutions.com`) for apps. The Next `(marketing)/page.tsx` is a **temporary app hub**, not a second full marketing site — keep it short; link to WordPress for the full story.

The canonical marketing design lives in the WordPress theme (sibling project on this machine):

`c:\xampp\htdocs\aicoachingsite\wp-content\themes\ai-coaching-solutions\`

Read before large UI changes:
- `assets/css/main.css` — tokens, `.btn`, `.hero`, `.section`, `.tool-card`, `.mvp-callout`
- `template-parts/sections/hero.php`, `platform-overview.php`, `practice-planner.php`, `swing-analyzer.php`, `break90.php`

