## Patterns to mirror

- **Hero**: full-width video or dark scrim, left-aligned copy, gold eyebrow, MVP “Early access open” card, primary CTAs below the card (left-aligned, not page-centered).
- **Sections**: `.section` vertical rhythm, gold uppercase kickers, white H2, muted subtitle.
- **Tool cards**: dark card bg, logo panel on `rgba(248,250,252,0.08)`, badges (Lead tool / MVP coaches / MVP golfers).
- **Buttons**: primary = gold bg + navy text; secondary = outline on dark.

## This repo vs WordPress

- **App hub** (`src/app/(marketing)/page.tsx`): compact tool launcher + `NEXT_PUBLIC_MARKETING_SITE_URL` link back to WordPress. Only Free Analyzer is live; Practice Planner and Break90 use `/practice-planner` and `/break90` coming-soon MVP pages (waitlist, not `/app/*` yet).
- **App routes** (`src/app/app/`, `free-breakdown/`): coach-first **light** shell in `globals.css` (off-white bg, orange CTAs) is OK unless user asks to unify.
- Do not copy PHP into React for the Vercel home; evolve WordPress theme for marketing changes.
- Use env URLs: `NEXT_PUBLIC_MARKETING_SITE_URL`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_BREAK90_URL`, practice planner `/app/practice-planner`, free analyzer `/free-breakdown`.

## MVP query params (app links)

- Practice Planner MVP: `?mvp=coach`
- Break90 MVP: `?mvp=golfer`

See `docs/brand-alignment.md` in this repo for full workflow.
